# =========================
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# =========================
# Intentional artifacts (do NOT ignore)
# =========================
# data/processed, data/interim, data/raw/fastf1_cache,
# results/models, results subdirectories and
# tests/fixtures/legacy_predictions.json are part of the
# R0 baseline and must remain tracked. Do not add *.pkl,
# *.csv or data/ exclusions here without an artifact-policy
# update in docs/V2_REPOSITORY_AUDIT.md.